        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Alung !@9 ninge tingkauh ram tei,",
            "Tabui nung ai guang tang nicho?",
            "Njianmei guai le ntammei guai,",
            "Miram khou tei souriu dat khang.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He Raguang nang tingsang ram khou tei,",
            "Jailou ganglou dat ro;",
            "Tabui nung!@9 ai khoutei guangtang nina cho?",
            "He Raguang kandih khou rianramei na guai.",
            "",
            "2. Tingkauh chang njuan na tat bam khou,",
            "Chang dinlou o he Raguang Jisu;",
            "Nang ramgai tei ai !@9 hou ni e,",
            "Tabui nung!@9 ai guangtang nina cho?",
            "",
            "3. Kandih khou tam kanmei jianmei guai,",
            "Tabui nung !@9 guang tang nina cho?",
            "Nang ramgai tei guangtang puinung kiu,",
            "Neilamei pari ra cham ni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
